WEBVTT

00:00:00.060 --> 00:00:03.218
Explore a later executive slot and check the latest

00:00:03.244 --> 00:00:07.730
useful decision time This can preserve morning commitments if

00:00:07.809 --> 00:00:12.073
the supplier accepts a feasible alternative Do not promise

00:00:12.086 --> 00:00:15.692
a slot before checking availability and the decision deadline
